        "snippet": "2024-08-15 06:00\n  [查看原文](https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MzAxMzIzNA==&mid=2650198134&idx=1&sn=1b84af0cf895e0251c1f24410529d61f&chksm=bf0666af18afea2c65358c356fa32ba20879dc7a36b477586ed998032926a99c0bd6d0710525&scene=0&xtrack=1)\n\n收藏\n\n了解企业： [![](https://vcdn.pharmcube.com/drawbed/1711508728909_企业-彩色.svg) 礼来](/investgo/company/detail/0f6d6d6267672e740008ee3020f830d4)[![](https://vcdn.pharmcube.com/drawbed/1711508728909_企业-彩色.svg) 诺和诺德](/investgo/company/detail/fb33e45570987634172a5a5ec1dd3076)\n\n了解药品： [![](https://vcdn.pharmcube.com/drawbed/1705283222635_药品-彩色.svg) GLP-1](/nextpharma/drug/detail/56b345839463089c57d6db450906316c)[![](https://vcdn.pharmcube.com/drawbed/1705283222635_药品-彩色.svg) 司美格鲁肽](/nextpharma/drug/detail/8680ca2b1ba05704e65b45ab870d136c)",
