      {
        "id": "ev_passage_6899beb6adc954fc",
        "source_type": "passage",
        "provider": "direct_http",
        "url": "https://bydrug.pharmcube.com/news/detail/5351f5bbb305403207b432b967997d59",
        "document_id": null,
        "title": "舆情看点｜GLP-1类药物减重适应证接连获批——赛道竞争加剧，头部企业优势面临挑战医药新闻-ByDrug-一站式医药资源共享中心-医药魔方",
        "snippet": "本网站转载文章仅为方便读者查阅和了解相关信息，并不代表我们认同其观点和内容。读者应自行判断和鉴别转载文章的真实性、合法性和有效性。\n\n了解相关企业\n\n![](https://vcdn.pharmcube.com/drawbed/1711522611012_企业@2x.png)\n\n![](https://vcdn.pharmcube.com/drawbed/1710471990234_ig_defaultIcon.png)\n\n礼来\n\n推测估值/动态市值：\n\n--\n\n![](https://vcdn.pharmcube.com/drawbed/1711522611012_企业@2x.png)\n\n![](https://vcdn.pharmcube.com/drawbed/1710471990234_ig_defaultIcon.png)\n\n诺和诺德\n\n推测估值/动态市值：\n\n--\n\n了解相关药品\n\n![](https://vcdn.pharmcube.com/drawbed/1711522611040_药品@2x.png)\n\nGLP-1\n\n作用机制：\n\n-\n\n研发机构：\n\n-\n\n![](https://vcdn.pharmcube.com/drawbed/1711522611040_药品@2x.png)\n\n司美格鲁肽\n\n作用机制：\n\n-\n\n研发机构：\n\n-\n\n同类资讯\n\n[![](https://pharmcube-pat.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/wechat_mp_logo/5aa9db9f4bc6a6f89d4f4a9a3725e582.png)\n\n中国医药报\n\n共发布文章1368篇](/news/summary/source/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%8C%BB%E8%8D%AF%E6%8A%A5)\n\n医药日历",
